            "review_title": "Review at Khai Minh",
            "review_text": "Victorvladovich\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam30 contributions\n1\nfriendly service and organic food\nOct 2018 • Friends\nI am very happy that this unique shop really care of natural ingredients. Brown rice noodles, no sugar and MSG. Affordable price and fresh cooked meal served at family style restaurant. It’s my favorite place for daily meal. For address please use this location. They haven’t updated tripadvisor \n157 Điện Biên Phủ, P.15, Quận Bình Thạnh \nKhai Minh Quận 5\n\n105B Ngô Quyền, P. 11, Quận 5\nĐT: 082 999 5959 – 028.38.538953\n(giữa An Dương Vương + Nguyễn Trãi)\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 2, 2018",
