            "review_text": "Corbatron\n47 contributions\n0\nAmazing healthy food!\nApr 2017 • Solo\nStopped by this place to try and was amazed at the natural selection of foods that were fresh, light and healthy. I left feeling amazing. If you are looking for foods with excessive sugar, msg or cheap vegetables... This is not the place for you. And with all of the said, the price was amazing. Must try if you are a healthy food lover.\nWritten April 7, 2017",
